      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LATEST TWIST (1) jumps from the inside draw. Last start finished 4th in a Grade 5 on September 1 over 388m at Gosford behind Kaelix Comet beaten 5.5 lengths (22.63). Looks hard to beat with even luck. SUNBURNT KEEPER (7) turned in a solid run last start over 472m at Bulli finishing 5th and beaten only 4 lengths (26.92). Better than last start and can bounce back. WHITEY (2) turned spotting a big start finishing fourth (22.82) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. Goes well out of this box with a win and three minor placings. Has ability and can atone. PURE MOUSE (4) has been in the money at his last two runs, most recently when third (22.78) in a Grade 5 over 400m at this track.",
